ific, and social prominence in the 1950s; to its politicization in the 1970s and 1980s. Looking forward, he considers the consequences of managed care on the politics of disease in the twenty-first century.\". \"Dying in the City of the Blues offers valuable new insight into the African American experience, the impact of race relations and ideologies on health care, and the politics of science, medicine, and disease.\"--BOOK JACKET.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Haematology","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Health systems & services","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History of medicine","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Medical anthropology","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Racism & racial discrimination","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Memphis","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Medical Hematology","sourceId":"source-open-library-dying-in-the-city-of-the-blues-sickle-cell-anemia-and-the-politics-of-race-and-health-keith-wail"},{"source":"open_li